admintonworld.com\\/news\\/marijke-lagerlof-the-dutch-cyclist-with-a-secret-passion-for-badminton\\/>."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2069, "end": 2116, "text": "* WikiProject Badminton\\/tournament focus list."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 115, "text": "Title: The Unseen Champions: Uncovering the Hidden Heroes of Dutch Cycling and Wikipedia's Quest for Gender Balance"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 117, "end": 260, "text": "In the world of track cycling, few names resonate as strongly as Marijke Lagerlöf, a Dutch athlete who has left an indelible mark on the sport."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 261, "end": 497, "text": "But beyond her impressive achievements on the track, Lagerlöf's story takes an unexpected turn, one that weaves together the threads of athletic excellence, Wikipedia's quest for gender balance, and the unsung heroes of the digital age."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 498, "end": 631, "text": "In the Netherlands, a country renowned for its cycling culture, Lagerlöf's name is synonymous with speed, agility, and determination."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 632, "end": 754, "text": "With a career spanning multiple championships and records, she has inspired countless young athletes to take up the sport."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 755, "end": 860, "text": "Yet, despite her impressive résumé, Lagerlöf's online presence was, until recently, surprisingly limited."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 861, "end": 928, "text": "This is where the NL Gendergap maintenance project comes into play."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 929, "end": 1108, "text": "Launched by a group of dedicated Wikipedians, this initiative aims to bridge the gender gap on the Dutch-language Wikipedia by creating and improving articles about notable women."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1109, "end": 1280, "text": "The project's focus list, a curated selection of individuals who have made significant contributions to their respective fields, features none other than Marijke Lagerlöf."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1281, "end": 1457, "text": "Evidence of Lagerlöf's inclusion on the focus list can be found on the project's Wikipedia page, where her name appears alongside other trailblazing women from the Netherlands."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1458, "end": 1673, "text": "This is no coincidence; the NL Gendergap maintenance project has been working tirelessly to ensure that women like Lagerlöf, who have been overlooked or underrepresented online, receive the recognition they deserve."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1674, "end": 1738, "text": "But why is Lagerlöf's presence on the focus list so significant?"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1739, "end": 1770, "text": "The answer lies in the numbers."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1771, "end": 1874, "text": "According to a 2020 report, only 18.2% of biographical articles on the Dutch Wikipedia are about women."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1875, "end": 2059, "text": "This staggering imbalance is not unique to the Netherlands; it is a global phenomenon, with women's contributions and achievements often marginalized or erased from the digital record."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2060, "end": 2223, "text": "By including Lagerlöf on their focus list, the NL Gendergap maintenance project is not only acknowledging her athletic prowess but also challenging the status quo."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2224, "end": 2381, "text": "They are saying that women like Lagerlöf, who have broken barriers and pushed boundaries in their respective fields, deserve to be recognized and celebrated."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2382, "end": 2497, "text": "As we delve deeper into Lagerlöf's story, we find that her inclusion on the focus list is not just a token gesture."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "NL Gendergap maintenance project", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Wikimedia project", "scope": "Marijke Lagerlöf's focus list inclusion", "claim": "Marijke Lagerlöf has been listed on the focus list for the NL Gendergap maintenance project.", "answer": "NL Gendergap maintenance project", "quote": "This is where the NL Gendergap maintenance project comes into play. Launched by a group of dedicated Wikipedians, this initiative aims to bridge the gender gap on the Dutch-language Wikipedia by creating and improving articles about notable women. The project's focus list, a curated selection of individuals who have made significant contributions to their respective fields, features none other than Marijke Lagerlöf. Evidence of Lagerlöf's inclusion on the focus list can be found on the project's Wikipedia page, where her name appears alongside other trailblazing women from the Netherlands.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["WikiProject Badminton/tournament focus list", "NL Gendergap maintenance project"]}
